      <p class="text-sm">Please DM me on my Discord server if you have any concern. The comments are not automatically pinged to me so I miss them. Please not share the novels on SNS, you will risk them being taken down. For alternative payment, please contact me on my Discord server so I can direct you to the website! For novel&#039;s list, updates, request, and to report mistakes, join here: https://discord.gg/XgDhgMqyTn</p>
